t found it too time-consuming and overwhelming, with the pressure of production deadlines causing their passion to wane. They also tried reviewing an album in 2019 but felt it was unproductive and forced them to conform to a template that didn't suit their natural, spontaneous, and emotional style. Their reviews were often criticized for not being objective, which made them less engaged and led them to second-guess their thoughts and emotional connection to the music. This external pressure and fear of backlash overshadowed the joy they once found in sharing their perspective. They ultimately realized their passion for music needed to be expressed in a more personal, less public way, and they began considering alternative methods like sharing playlists or discussing music with friends rather than producing polished reviews.\",\n          \"source_ids\": [\"s3\", \"s4\", \"s5\", \"s16\", \"s17\", \"s18\", \"s19\", \"s20\", \"s40\", \"s41\"],\n          \"entity_scope\": \"user\",\n          \"time_scope\": \"past\",\n          \"parent_versions\": {},\n          \"retract_ids\": [],\n          \"reason\": \"The user's own statements across multiple conversations describe their past experiences with music reviewing and content creation, including the podcast in 2018, the album review attempt in 2019, the criticism they faced, and the resulting loss of joy and shift toward more personal expression.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"unresolved\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}", "response_metadata": {"finish_reason": "stop", "refusal": null, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7386, "total_tokens": 7775, "completion_tokens": 389, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": null, "accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null}}, "response_id": "chatcmpl-81ce4e2a70b167c4", "protocol": "plain"}, "response_ref": "091bfb8ab75aa2b4f28608aa97beaf22a4ce699220c1dc4803232fcf9500b21c", "output_tokens_estimate": 601, "finish_r