an producing polished reviews or structured content. They have found joy in organizing a festival highlighting Pacific Islander artists, which is a meaningful cultural expression, but they have moved away from public-facing analytical music writing and podcasting due to the pressure and loss of joy.\",\n          \"source_ids\": [\"s3\", \"s4\", \"s5\", \"s16\", \"s17\", \"s18\", \"s19\", \"s20\", \"s28\", \"s29\", \"s30\", \"s31\", \"s32\", \"s40\", \"s41\"],\n          \"entity_scope\": \"user\",\n          \"time_scope\": \"current\",\n          \"parent_versions\": {},\n          \"retract_ids\": [],\n          \"reason\": \"The user explicitly states that formal reviewing felt like conforming to a template that drained fun (s3, s4), and that they now consider alternative methods like sharing playlists or discussing with friends (s5). They also describe pausing a podcast because it became a chore (s16-s20) and losing interest in analytical music theory (s40, s41). More recently, they organized a successful festival celebrating Pacific Islander artists (s28-s32), indicating a shift toward personal, community-oriented cultural expression rather than public critical writing.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"unresolved\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}", "response_metadata": {"finish_reason": "stop", "refusal": null, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7390, "total_tokens": 7748, "completion_tokens": 358, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": null, "accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null}}, "response_id": "chatcmpl-a35ebbb17f542b92", "protocol": "plain"}, "response_ref": "a69f3db7656f300cf3ff93c71f9c3e66cd864ab146ac6db909e95028b5fd986b", "output_tokens_estimate": 511, "finish_reason": "stop", "refusal": null, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7390, "total_tokens": 7748, "completion_tokens": 358, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": null, "acc